      "Express",
      "Force",
      "L2150"
    ],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Battery-operated automatic catchweighing instrument (Category Y) comprising an electronic indicator, pressure transducer and sensors mounted on a wheeled loader. The pattern automatically determines the load in the bucket during the lifting process; the hydraulic pressure in the loader's arms is converted by a pressure transducer, the output being used by the indicator to display the corresponding weight."
